<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><ns2:section xmlns:ns2="http://rest.cis.illinois.edu" id="62512" href="schedule/2023/spring/GLBL/296/62512.xml"><parents><calendarYear id="2023" href="schedule/2023.xml">2023</calendarYear><term id="120231" href="schedule/2023/spring.xml">Spring 2023</term><subject id="GLBL" href="schedule/2023/spring/GLBL.xml">Global Studies</subject><course id="296" href="schedule/2023/spring/GLBL/296.xml">Global St Foundation Seminar</course></parents><sectionNumber>DS </sectionNumber><sectionTitle>Euro.Sustainability &amp; Degrowth</sectionTitle><sectionDateRange>Meets 13-Mar-23 - 03-May-23.</sectionDateRange><statusCode>A</statusCode><sectionText>This seminar will survey key issues related to renewable energy; decarbonization; environmental sustainability; green capitalism; and degrowth in Europe (including some relevant comparisons to the U.S., Japan, and countries in the Global South). The course will look at Europe’s environmental and energy concerns in relation to issues of EU identity and policy; market economics; energy and food security; and the mitigation of global environmental catastrophe.</sectionText><partOfTerm>B</partOfTerm><sectionStatusCode>A</sectionStatusCode><enrollmentStatus>Open</enrollmentStatus><startDate>2023-03-13Z</startDate><endDate>2023-05-03Z</endDate><meetings><meeting id="0"><type code="LCD">Lecture-Discussion</type><start>03:00 PM</start><end>04:50 PM</end><daysOfTheWeek>W      </daysOfTheWeek><meetingDateRange>Meets 13-Mar-23 - 03-May-23.</meetingDateRange><instructors><instructor lastName="Schrag" firstName="D">Schrag, D</instructor></instructors></meeting></meetings></ns2:section>